message: "If you use this repository, please cite the thesis artifact below."
title: "Safeguarding Synthetic Agency - A Framework for Measuring and Operationalizing System Integrity in Synthetic Social Agent Systems"
url: "https://github.com/JelleTuls/Safeguarding-Synthetic-Agency"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JelleTuls/Safeguarding-Synthetic-Agency"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Tuls"
