abstract: >-
  Companion codebase for a thesis project on safeguarding synthetic social
  agents. The repository implements persona chat, a lightweight baseline, a
  layered guardrailed SSA pipeline, automated red-teaming, optional human review,
  saved final-result reports, and reproducible computational-analysis figures.
keywords:
  - synthetic social agents
  - guardrails
  - red-teaming
  - LLM evaluation
  - computational analysis
  - system integrity
